<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>vic.in.bloom</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --cream:#fefaf0; --dark:#403f2b; --olive:#c4c197; --sage:#e1e2cf; --grey:#666460;
  --serif:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;
  --sans:'Helvetica Neue','HelveticaNeue-Light',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
  --avenir:'Avenir Next','Avenir','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:var(--cream);color:var(--dark);font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:300;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
img{display:block;max-width:100%}
a{color:inherit}
.serif{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-variation-settings:'opsz' 120;line-height:1}
.page{display:none}
.page.active{display:block}

/* Header */
header.site{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:var(--cream);height:115px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 100px 0 111px}
.menu-btn{background:none;border:0;font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-variation-settings:'opsz' 120;font-size:25px;color:var(--dark);cursor:pointer}
.brand{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-variation-settings:'opsz' 120;font-size:30px;text-decoration:none;position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%)}
.logo img{width:97px;height:97px}
.overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:var(--olive);z-index:100;display:none;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;overflow:auto}
.overlay.open{display:flex}
.overlay .top{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:115px;position:relative;flex:none}
.overlay .close{position:absolute;left:30px;top:40px;background:none;border:0;font-size:34px;line-height:1;color:var(--dark);cursor:pointer;font-weight:200}
.overlay nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:40px 20px 60px}
.overlay nav a{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-variation-settings:'opsz' 120;font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,64px);text-decoration:none;line-height:1.2;text-align:center}
.overlay nav a:hover{opacity:.65}

/* Buttons */
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:142px;height:40px;background:var(--dark);color:var(--cream);text-decoration:none;font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:300;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.1em;border:0;cursor:pointer}
.btn:hover{opacity:.85}
.btn.light{background:var(--cream);color:var(--grey);border-radius:20px;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;font-family:var(--avenir)}
.btn.wide{width:238px}

/* Home */
.hero{position:relative;height:575px;background:url(img/hero.jpg) center 35%/cover;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;color:#fff}
.hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(64,63,43,.38)}
.hero>*{position:relative}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(64px,13.75vw,176px);line-height:.9;color:#fff}
.hero p{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-variation-settings:'opsz' 120;font-size:clamp(20px,2.7vw,35px);color:var(--cream);margin-top:30px}
.create{padding:20px 0 70px;text-align:center}
.create h2{font-size:clamp(44px,5.4vw,69px);line-height:1.4}
.cards{display:flex;gap:40px;padding:30px 0 0 166px}
.card{width:297px;text-align:center;text-decoration:none}
.card .ph{position:relative;height:340px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden}
.card .ph img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.card .ph span{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:24px;color:#fff;font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:700;font-size:30px;text-shadow:0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
.card b{display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;margin-top:14px;text-decoration:underline}
.card .pr{font-size:20px}
.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;min-height:615px}
.split .txt{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:60px 60px 60px 107px}
.split .txt h3{font-size:65px;line-height:1;max-width:360px}
.split .txt p{font-size:20px;margin-top:40px}
.split .txt .btn{margin-top:40px}
.split .img{position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.split .img img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.bg-olive{background:var(--olive)} .bg-dark{background:var(--dark);color:var(--olive)} .bg-sage{background:var(--sage)}
.split.rev .txt{padding-left:104px}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:44px 20px 50px;text-align:center}
.stats .n{font-size:65px}
.stats .l{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-variation-settings:'opsz' 120;font-size:23px;line-height:1.4;margin:34px auto 0;max-width:160px}
.testi{background:var(--dark);color:#fff;height:460px;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.testi .slide{display:none;max-width:800px;padding:0 60px;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:clamp(20px,2.35vw,30px);line-height:1.8}
.testi .slide.on{display:block;animation:fade .6s}
@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}
.testi .arr{position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);background:none;border:0;color:#fff;font-size:30px;cursor:pointer;padding:10px 20px;font-weight:200}
.testi .prev{left:80px}.testi .next{right:80px}
.testi .dots{position:absolute;bottom:50px;display:flex;gap:12px}
.testi .dots button{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;border:0;background:#e8e6e6;opacity:.6;cursor:pointer;padding:0}
.testi .dots button.on{background:#fff;opacity:1}
.gift{height:648px;background:url(img/9987.jpg) center/cover;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.gift .box{background:var(--cream);width:480px;max-width:90%;padding:46px 40px 50px;text-align:center}
.gift h3{font-size:39px;line-height:1.2}
.gift p{margin:22px auto 30px;max-width:390px;line-height:1.8}
.follow{text-align:center;padding:40px 0 60px}
.follow h2{font-size:35px;line-height:1.4}
.follow .handle{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-variation-settings:'opsz' 120;font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,65px);text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;margin-top:4px}
.feed{position:relative;max-width:1064px;margin:40px auto 0;padding:0 12px}
.feed .track{display:flex;gap:24px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scrollbar-width:none}
.feed .track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.feed .track a{flex:0 0 280px;height:280px;scroll-snap-align:start;overflow:hidden}
.feed .track img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .4s}
.feed .track a:hover img{transform:scale(1.04)}
.feed .nx{position:absolute;right:0;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.6);border:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:20px;color:var(--dark)}

/* Footer */
footer.site{background:var(--olive);padding:40px 109px 40px;min-height:285px}
footer .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:600px 130px 1fr;gap:0}
footer .big{font-size:65px;line-height:1}
footer .tag{max-width:400px;line-height:1.9;margin-top:12px}
footer nav a{display:block;line-height:40px;text-decoration:underline}
footer .legal{line-height:1.6}
footer .legal b{font-weight:700}

/* Giftcard */
.intro{padding:70px 172px 40px}
.intro h1{font-size:56px;line-height:.9}
.intro p{max-width:732px;margin-top:40px}
.intro p+p{margin-top:0}
.intro .btn{margin-top:26px}
.three{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,295px);gap:60px;justify-content:center;padding:60px 0 80px}
.three .c img{width:295px;height:323px;object-fit:cover}
.three .c .t{background:var(--olive);margin:-40px 0 0 22px;position:relative;padding:22px 22px 26px;min-height:180px}
.three .c h4{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-variation-settings:'opsz' 120;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:10px}
.three .c ul{padding-left:28px}
.three .c li{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}
.formsec{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;padding:50px 90px 90px;gap:40px}
.formsec .left{position:relative;min-height:640px}
.formsec h2{font-size:56px;line-height:1.15;max-width:300px;position:relative;z-index:1}
.formsec .p1{position:absolute;left:318px;top:74px;width:283px;height:466px;object-fit:cover}
.formsec .p2{position:absolute;left:89px;top:442px;width:310px;height:206px;object-fit:cover;z-index:2}
form.f{background:var(--cream);width:341px;padding:24px;align-self:start;justify-self:center}
form.f.wide{width:500px}
.f label{display:block;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px}
.f .fld{margin-bottom:28px}
.f input,.f select,.f textarea{width:100%;height:42px;border:1px solid rgba(64,63,43,.6);background:var(--cream);font:inherit;font-size:14px;color:var(--dark);padding:0 12px;border-radius:0}
.f textarea{height:92px;padding:10px 12px;resize:vertical}
.f .hint{font-size:14px;color:var(--grey);margin-top:6px}
.f .phone{display:flex;align-items:center;border:1px solid rgba(64,63,43,.6);height:42px}
.f .phone span{padding:0 6px 0 12px;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap}
.f .phone input{border:0;height:40px;padding-left:4px}
.f button{width:100%;height:41px;background:var(--dark);color:var(--cream);border:0;font:inherit;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer}
.f .msg{margin-top:14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;display:none}
.f .msg.on{display:block}

/* Picking pages */
.pick{position:relative;padding:181px 80px 120px 0;min-height:922px}
.pick .ph{margin-left:427px;height:622px}
.pick .ph img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.pick .panel{position:absolute;left:100px;top:134px;width:500px;min-height:715px;background:var(--dark);color:var(--cream);padding:73px 50px 60px 27px}
.pick h1{font-size:56px;line-height:1.15}
.pick .body{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:28px;max-width:430px}
.pick .body p+p{margin-top:0}
.pick .meta{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;font-style:italic;margin-top:14px}
.pick .meta b{font-weight:700}
.pick .btn{margin-top:20px}
.get{text-align:center;padding:20px 0 40px}
.get h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-variation-settings:'opsz' 120;font-size:38px}
.get .boxes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,300px);gap:30px;justify-content:center;margin-top:24px}
.get .boxes div{border:1px solid var(--dark);min-height:150px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px 26px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6}
.closing{text-align:center;padding:60px 20px 80px}
.closing p{font-size:20px;line-height:1.8;max-width:863px;margin:0 auto 40px}

/* On demand */
.band{background:var(--olive);text-align:center;padding:90px 20px 60px}
.band h1{font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,65px);line-height:1;max-width:948px;margin:0 auto}
.band p{font-size:20px;max-width:660px;margin:30px auto 0}
.how{position:relative;padding:70px 80px 150px}
.how img{width:707px;height:362px;object-fit:cover}
.how .t{position:absolute;left:557px;right:80px;top:140px;background:var(--olive);padding:80px 60px 70px;min-height:386px}
.how h3{font-size:56px}
.how ul{margin-top:30px;padding-left:20px}
.plan{text-align:center;padding:30px 20px 80px}
.plan h2{font-size:65px}
.plan .sub{font-size:14px;margin:14px 0 20px}
.plan form{text-align:left;margin:0 auto}

/* FAQ */
.faq{max-width:980px;margin:35px auto 70px;padding:32px}
.faq h1{font-size:65px;line-height:1.2}
.faq .tab{display:inline-block;margin:80px 0 0 27px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--dark);padding-bottom:10px}
.faq .list{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
.faq details{border:1px solid rgba(64,63,43,.6);background:var(--cream)}
.faq summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:27px 60px 27px 25px;font-size:18px;position:relative}
.faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.faq summary::after{content:"";position:absolute;right:28px;top:34px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:1px solid var(--dark);border-bottom:1px solid var(--dark);transform:rotate(45deg)}
.faq details[open] summary::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);top:38px}
.faq details div{padding:0 60px 30px 25px;line-height:1.5}

/* Contact */
.contact .band{background:var(--cream);padding:90px 20px 50px}
.contact-split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;min-height:585px}
.contact-split .txt{padding:160px 40px 60px 83px}
.contact-split h2{font-size:65px}
.contact-split p{font-size:20px;margin-top:22px}
.contact-split .img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}

/* Shop */
.shop{padding:0 20px 60px}
.crumbs{padding:4px 0 20px;font-size:16px}
.crumbs a{text-decoration:none}
.banner{height:280px;object-fit:cover;width:100%}
.shop h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-variation-settings:'opsz' 120;font-size:28px;margin-top:24px}
.shop .desc{max-width:672px;margin-top:8px}
.shop .body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px 1fr;gap:40px;margin-top:60px}
.shop .side h4{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-variation-settings:'opsz' 120;font-size:20px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(64,63,43,.3);padding-bottom:14px;margin-bottom:20px}
.shop .side a{display:block;text-decoration:none;line-height:2.05}
.shop .bar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:14px;color:var(--grey);margin-bottom:20px}
.shop .bar span:last-child{color:var(--dark);font-size:16px}
.prod{width:320px;display:block;text-decoration:none}
.prod .pi{position:relative;height:320px}
.prod .pi img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.prod .pi span{position:absolute;left:13px;top:12px;background:var(--dark);color:var(--cream);font-size:14px;padding:2px 12px}
.prod p{margin-top:12px}.prod .pp{color:var(--grey)}
.product{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;max-width:1000px;margin:20px auto 80px;padding:0 20px}
.product img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:2/3;object-fit:cover}
.product h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-variation-settings:'opsz' 120;font-size:32px}
.product .price{font-size:20px;margin:10px 0 24px}
.product .qty{width:100px;height:40px;border:1px solid rgba(64,63,43,.6);background:var(--cream);font:inherit;padding:0 10px;margin:6px 0 20px}
.product .btn{width:100%;margin-bottom:10px}
.product .btn.outline{background:transparent;color:var(--dark);border:1px solid var(--dark)}
.product .note{font-size:14px;margin:4px 0 14px;display:none}.product .note.on{display:block}
.product details{border-top:1px solid rgba(64,63,43,.3);padding:16px 0}
.product details:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(64,63,43,.3)}
.product summary{cursor:pointer;letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:14px}
.product details p{margin-top:12px;font-size:15px}

/* Responsive */
@media (max-width:1000px){
  header.site{padding:0 20px;height:80px}
  .brand{font-size:22px}.logo img{width:60px;height:60px}.menu-btn{font-size:20px}
  .cards{justify-content:center;padding-left:0}
  .split,.split.rev{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .split .img{min-height:420px}
  .split.rev .img{order:-1}
  .split .txt,.split.rev .txt{padding:60px 30px}
  .split .txt h3{font-size:48px}
  .stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;row-gap:40px}
  .testi .prev{left:6px}.testi .next{right:6px}
  .testi{height:auto;padding:70px 0 90px}
  footer.site{padding:40px 30px}
  footer .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}
  footer .big{font-size:48px}
  .intro{padding:50px 30px 30px}
  .three{grid-template-columns:295px;gap:50px}
  .formsec{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:40px 30px 70px}
  .formsec .left{min-height:auto}
  .formsec .p1,.formsec .p2{position:static;width:100%;height:300px;margin-top:20px}
  form.f,form.f.wide{width:100%;max-width:500px}
  .pick{padding:20px 0 60px;min-height:0}
  .pick .ph{margin:0;height:360px}
  .pick .panel{position:static;width:auto;min-height:0;padding:50px 30px}
  .pick h1{font-size:44px}
  .get .boxes{grid-template-columns:1fr;max-width:320px;margin:24px auto 0}
  .how{padding:40px 20px 60px}.how img{width:100%;height:300px}
  .how .t{position:static;padding:40px 30px}
  .plan h2,.faq h1,.contact-split h2{font-size:44px}
  .contact-split{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .contact-split .txt{padding:40px 30px}
  .contact-split .img{height:400px}
  .shop .body{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .product{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="site">
  <button class="menu-btn" id="openMenu" aria-label="Menu">Menu</button>
  <a class="brand" href="#home">vic.in.bloom</a>
  <a class="logo" href="#home"><img src="img/logo.png" alt="vic.in.bloom logo"></a>
</header>

<div class="overlay" id="menu" role="dialog" aria-label="Site menu">
  <div class="top"><button class="close" id="closeMenu" aria-label="Close">&#x2715;</button><a class="brand" href="#home" style="position:static;transform:none">vic.in.bloom</a></div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#giftcard">Giftcard</a>
    <a href="#wild-flowers-picking">Wild Flowers Picking</a>
    <a href="#dahlia-flower-picking">Dahlia Flower Picking</a>
    <a href="#on-demand-workshop">On Demand Flower Workshop</a>
    <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    <a href="#shop">Shop</a>
  </nav>
</div>

<main>
<!-- ================= HOME ================= -->
<section class="page" id="p-home">
  <div class="hero">
    <h1 class="serif">Vic in bloom</h1>
    <p>self care &amp; beauty through flowers</p>
  </div>

  <div class="create">
    <h2 class="serif">Create with me</h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <a class="card" href="#dahlia-flower-picking">
        <div class="ph"><img src="img/9972.jpg" alt="Dahlia Flower Picking"><span>26 September</span></div>
        <b>Dahlia Flower Picking</b>
        <div class="pr">39,9€</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="split">
    <div class="txt bg-olive"><h3 class="serif">Flower school online</h3><p>Coming soon</p></div>
    <div class="img"><img src="img/9956.jpg" alt=""></div>
  </div>
  <div class="split rev">
    <div class="img"><img src="img/9949.jpg" alt=""></div>
    <div class="txt bg-dark"><h3 class="serif">Private Floral Coaching</h3><p>Coming soon</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="split">
    <div class="txt bg-sage"><h3 class="serif">On-demand workshop</h3><div><a class="btn" href="#on-demand-workshop">More</a></div></div>
    <div class="img"><img src="img/9979.jpg" alt=""></div>
  </div>

  <div class="stats">
    <div><div class="n serif">400+</div><div class="l">Participants joined</div></div>
    <div><div class="n serif">50+</div><div class="l">Workshops hosted</div></div>
    <div><div class="n serif">8</div><div class="l">Years<br>of experience</div></div>
    <div><div class="n serif">10%</div><div class="l">Return customers</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="testi" id="testi">
    <button class="arr prev" aria-label="Previous">&#x2039;</button>
    <div class="slide on">"I only have positive things to say about the event. Vic is really sweet and created a nice safe environment for meeting and sharing with the other girls. The positive energy was there the entire time."</div>
    <div class="slide">"I got to learn quite a lot about the flowers that I didn't know before. The workshop itself was amazing, Vic offered support when it was needed and soft guidance but also let you go into your own creative mode to express your vision."</div>
    <div class="slide">"Vic offers beautiful flower workshops, you can tell she loves doing flower arrangements and she is super knowledgeable on it. She also helps you as much as needed for those of us that struggle by putting the bouquet together. If you get the chance, don't miss the possibility to join her for a workshop!"</div>
    <button class="arr next" aria-label="Next">&#x203A;</button>
    <div class="dots"><button class="on" aria-label="Slide 1"></button><button aria-label="Slide 2"></button><button aria-label="Slide 3"></button></div>
  </div>

  <div class="gift">
    <div class="box">
      <h3 class="serif">Looking for a special gift?</h3>
      <p>We’ve got you - choose a gift card for any amount or a specific floral workshop.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="#giftcard" style="letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;font-family:var(--avenir)">More</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="follow">
    <h2 class="serif">Follow Me</h2>
    <a class="handle" href="https://www.instagram.com/vic.in.bloom/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@vic.in.bloom</a>
    <div class="feed">
